<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh tenders for 100,000 tonnes of wheat.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh tenders for 100,000 tonnes of wheat.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh has tendered for 100,000 tonnes of U.S. grade-2 or Australian Standard or better Canadian winter red/spring wheat for shipment by February 21, food ministry officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>They said the ministry would open the tender on January 18. The result of the bidding will be known within two to three days after opening the tender.</p>
</text>
